    <briefdescription>
<para>Manages the live ROOT/TEve representations of session scenes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classfccvis_1_1backend_1_1root_1_1RootSceneManager" kindref="compound">RootSceneManager</ref> provides the main interface for opening, updating, querying, and closing ROOT representations of abstract <ref refid="classfccvis_1_1scene_1_1Scene" kindref="compound">fccvis::scene::Scene</ref> objects.</para>
<para>The manager holds a non-owning reference to an existing <ref refid="classfccvis_1_1session_1_1Session" kindref="compound">fccvis::session::Session</ref>. Abstract scenes are discovered from that session and materialized into <ref refid="classfccvis_1_1backend_1_1root_1_1RootScene" kindref="compound">RootScene</ref> objects when requested.</para>
<para>Multiple open scenes are tracked by their names. Opening an already open scene returns the existing materialization rather than creating a second ROOT representation.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classfccvis_1_1backend_1_1root_1_1RootScene" kindref="compound">RootScene</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classfccvis_1_1session_1_1Session" kindref="compound">fccvis::session::Session</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classfccvis_1_1scene_1_1Scene" kindref="compound">fccvis::scene::Scene</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
